	(text "VDD (pin 14) runs straight from VSYS (3.0-5.5 V). VDD_GPIO (pin 65) = V3 sets the logic level\nof every GPIO. ENABLE (pin 10) high = SiP regulator on; pulled up to VSYS as in the reference kit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7d44df61-4b98-4b54-9b0a-1bc28d7f547c"))
	(text "FB201: 0 R link - lift it and insert a PPK2 to measure the nRF alone (sleep-current work).\nC201/C202 at pin 14, C203/C204 at pin 65, C205 at DEC0 - values from the Nordic-based reference kit.\nAUX (37) and GPS (42) unused: GNSS not fitted (report 4.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 110 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5da44c3d-90a9-45fc-a09f-d749e2bc047e"))
