	(text "SWD is the only way in: it goes to the dock pads through the limiter cells (dock sheet).\n~RESET: no external pull-up allowed (Nordic); brought to a test pad only.\nCOEX0 goes high whenever the modem's RF is active; it is looped back to P0.29 so\nfirmware can blank the grip sensor during transmit (AT%XCOEX0, report E-3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9fc7faf9-b516-41f7-845c-17a1e63e7a96"))
	(text "SIM_DET must float (Nordic). MAGPIO0-2, COEX1-2 and the MIPI RFFE pins are only for\nexternal antenna tuners - none fitted, so all unconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 236 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3de53644-0395-498c-a1cb-8a32c1a3be7a"))
